I have performed a deep dive into your architecture, including `settings.py`, your `.bat` files, your frontend `package.json`, and both of your Security Implementation markdown files. 

Because you want to deploy to Vercel and ensure hackers cannot exploit plugins or bypass security, I looked for anything that was "temporarily disabled" or overly permissive.

